 "text": "Voter Registration - Oglala Lakota County, South Dakota\nSkip to content\nOctober 18, 2026\nOglala Lakota County, South Dakota\nHome\nOnline Map\nAbout\nDirectory »\nAuditors & Welfare Office\nClerk of Court\nPublic Health Nurse\nDirector of Equalization\nEmergency Management\nGIS\nHighway Department\nPlanning & Zoning\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff\nState’s Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeterans Service Officer\nWeed & Pest\nCommission »\nCounty Commissioners\n2026 Minute Archive\n2025 Minute Archive\n2024 Minute Archive\nOlder Minute Archive\nEmployment (2)\nQuick Links\nFall River Co.\nVoter Registration\nVoter Registration\nYou may print the Voter Registration Form in Adobe Acrobat, complete it, sign it and then send it to the county Auditor:\nAuditor’s Office\n906 N. River St.\nHot Springs, SD 57747\nRegistration deadline:\nThe deadline for registration is 15 days before any election. Your form must be received by the auditor by this deadline if you are to vote in the next election.\nForm: Voter Registration\nYou may register at the following locations:\nCounty auditor’s office\nCity finance office\nDriver’s license station\nPublic assistance agencies providing food stamps, TANF or WIC\nDepartment of Human Services offices which provide assistance to the disabled\nMilitary recruitment offices\nMail-in registration with cards from the county auditor’s office or from one of the links above\nTo register to vote in South Dakota, you must:\nBe a United States citizen\nReside in South Dakota\nBe at least 18 years old on or before the next election\nNot currently serving a sentence for a felony conviction which included imprisonment, served or suspended, in an adult penitentiary system\nNot be judged mentally incompetent by a court of law\nReturn to Elections page\nQuick Links\nAuditors & Welfare Office\nAbsentee Voting\nElections\nVoter Registration\nVoter Identification\nSD State Election Resources\nSD State Voter Portal\n2026 Summer Reassessment\nNational Active Fires Map\nWebsite Survey\nWebsite Survey\nPlease let us know about your visit to our site.\nWhere did you hear about this website? * Search Engine Friend Other\nWhat were your reasons for looking at our site? *\nGeneral Information\nSpecific Information\nCuriosity\nOther\nDid you find what you were looking for? *\nYes\nNo\nMaybe\nIf no, what information were you looking for? (Please be specific so that we can improve our website.) *\nIf you would like a response to your request for additional information please list your email below.\nSubmit\nReturn to top of page\nCopyright © 2026 on Genesis Framework · WordPress · Log in\nNotifications",
